        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 23, \"total_count\": 23, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No photo upload — sellers cannot attach their own photos\", \"actual\": \"The create-listing photo control has no file input at all (0 input[type=file] in the form); the \\\"Add Photo\\\" button only appends canned Unsplash stock images and the helper text reads \\\"Click to add sample images (up to 4)\\\". All other data was retained correctly: the created listing \\\"Restored Oak Dining Chair\\\" shows $120, Furniture, Good, Brooklyn NY, the submitted description, Upcycled badge, seller Testy Buyer, Listed 2026-08-28, and 2 photos.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Listing edit capability absent\", \"actual\": \"No edit affordance exists anywhere for an owned listing. /my-listings offers only \\\"View\\\", \\\"Mark Sold\\\" and \\\"Delete\\\" per item, and the owner's product detail page exposes only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\". There is no way to change title, description, photos, price, category, condition, location or upcycled status after creation.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /my-listings: \\\"Mark Sold\\\" flipped status Active->Sold and the button to \\\"Mark Available\\\"; clicking it flipped back to Active. \\\"Delete\\\" opened a \\\"Delete listing?\\\" confirm dialog — Cancel left the listing intact; Delete removed it immediately with toast \\\"Listing deleted\\\" and the page then showed \\\"No listings yet\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sold: Emma marked prod-5 Sold -> browse count 10 -> \\\"9 items available\\\" and prod-5 absent; viewing prod-5 as signed-in non-owner Marcus shows \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" with no Add to Cart and no Message Seller control. Deleted: a deleted listing disappeared from /my-listings and browse (11 -> 10 items), and a removed/unknown product id renders \\\"Product not found\\\" with no purchase controls.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered Testy Buyer / testbuyer1@example.com / pass123456 / Brooklyn, NY -> toast \\\"Account created successfully!\\\", redirected to home, header now shows \\\"Sell\\\" + cart + user menu (signed in).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Maximum-price filter control is missing/inoperable\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"Price Range\\\" control renders only ONE Radix thumb (aria-label=\\\"Minimum\\\", valuenow 0, min 0, max 500); there is no second/maximum thumb and no other max-price input in the filters panel (panel text: Special/Categories/Condition/Price Range $0-$500/Max Distance). Minimum can be raised (PageUp -> \\\"$100 - $500\\\", 5 items all >= $100) but the maximum is permanently pinned at $500, so buyers cannot apply a maximum-price criterion. Category (Furniture -> 3 correct items), condition (+New -> prod-10, prod-3), upcycled-only (5 upcycled items), distance (3 miles -> only the 2 Brooklyn listings), and sorting by newest/price-low ($45,$125,$175,$285,$320)/distance all worked correctly.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"wood\\\" -> 3 results (title match prod-10/prod-9, description match prod-1 \\\"wood frame\\\"); \\\"BROOKLYN\\\" -> 2 Brooklyn, NY listings (case-insensitive location match); clearing restored 10 items available.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Testy Buyer added prod-1 ($285) twice -> cart badge stayed 1 (no duplicate) and prod-9 ($35). Cart shows 2 items, each with photo, title, location (Brooklyn, NY / Austin, TX) and price; Total $320.00 = 285+35.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Testy Buyer on prod-1 (Emma Green's available listing): Message Seller dialog \\\"Send a message to Emma Green\\\"; Send button disabled while empty, enabled after typing; submitting produced toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" and closed the dialog.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selection does not filter browse results\", \"actual\": \"Clicking \\\"Home Decor\\\" (listed as \\\"2 items\\\") on /categories navigates to /?category=home-decor, but the browse grid still shows all 10 listings and the count still reads \\\"10 items available\\\"; the Home Decor filter toggle remains false. A direct fresh load of /?category=home-decor gives the same unfiltered result, so the category query parameter is ignored.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Sellers have no view of received purchase requests/messages\", \"actual\": \"After Testy Buyer sent a message on prod-1 and a cart purchase request for prod-1+prod-9, signing in as the seller Emma Green shows no requests anywhere: /my-listings only lists her two items with View/Mark Sold/Delete and no request or message section, and the \\\"My Profile\\\" menu entry navigates to a 404 \\\"Oops! Page not found\\\" page. The cart action reported \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\" and cleared the cart, but no request is recorded or viewable for any cart item.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with nobody-unregistered@example.com showed toast \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\" and stayed on /login with no session.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registering \\\"Fake Emma\\\" with EMMA@Example.com (case-only variant of emma@example.com) was rejected with \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\"; no session created and prod-1 still shows seller \\\"Emma Green\\\", so the original account was not replaced.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password not verified during authentication\", \"actual\": \"Logging in as emma@example.com with an arbitrary wrong password (\\\"totally-wrong-password-xyz\\\") succeeded and redirected to the signed-in home page. Login page itself states \\\"(any password works)\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Owner view of own listing exposes seller management (product.manage-listings on detail; Mark Sold / Delete / View on /my-listings, which lists only the signed-in user's items). Viewing another seller's listing (Testy Buyer on Emma Green's prod-1) exposes only Add to Cart and Message Seller — no edit/mark-sold/delete controls.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty submit blocked by required-field validation (\\\"Please fill out this field.\\\" on title/description/price/location); with text filled but no category/condition -> toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\"; with all fields but no photo -> toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\". No listing was created in any of these attempts.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is input[type=number] min=0 step=0.01. Entering -50 and submitting was rejected (\\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\") and stayed on /create-listing with no listing created; non-numeric text cannot be entered at all.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Protected routes render a blank page instead of a sign-in prompt or redirect\", \"actual\": \"While signed out, /cart, /create-listing and /my-listings all render an entirely empty page (document.body.innerText === \\\"\\\") with no sign-in prompt, message, or redirect to /login. Only the in-page controls behave correctly: Add to Cart redirects to /login and Message Seller shows a disabled \\\"Log in to message\\\" button.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting an existing email immediately showed toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\" while staying on /register with the form still rendered and editable (a corrected registration was then submitted successfully from the same form).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into browse.search updated browse.count from \\\"10 items available\\\" to \\\"3 items available\\\" and the product grid live, with no submit; clearing restored 10 immediately.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter/sort change re-rendered grid + browse.count instantly without reload (Furniture 10->3, +New ->2, distance 1mi -> \\\"0 items available\\\"/\\\"No items found\\\", upcycled-only ->5, sort changes reordered immediately). \\\"Clear all filters\\\" restored \\\"10 items available\\\" each time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Add to Cart immediately showed toast \\\"Added to cart!\\\" and header cart badge went 0->1->2 with no reload; cart page line items and $320.00 total reflected the additions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"prod-5 detail shows photo gallery, title \\\"Handmade Macrame Wall Hanging\\\", $45, category Home Decor, condition New, location \\\"Brooklyn, NY (3 mi)\\\", seller \\\"Emma Green\\\", \\\"Listed 2024-11-21\\\", \\\"Upcycled\\\" badge, and full description — all matching the browse-card and my-listings data. Availability is presented: available items offer Add to Cart, and once marked Sold the page shows \\\"This item is no longer available\\\". Same completeness verified on prod-1 and on a newly created listing.\"}]}"
